# Never commit these.
runs/

# Local assistant/editor instructions (may contain tenant and subscription ids)
.github/copilot-instructions.md
.claude/
.cursor/
CLAUDE.md

# Secrets - belt and braces; secrets should never be in files at all
*.env
.env*
*.pem
*.key
*secret*
*credential*
